5,1,1,talk,Minako,,The current split feels arbitrary. I need to know what an even share actually costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I worry about the social friction. How do we avoid resentment?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The car is often unusable when I need it. I need reliability.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,We are guessing at costs. I need the real numbers for fuel and tax.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I spend too much time arranging things. I want to see where the hours go.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, if we have the numbers, we can set a fair baseline.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, reliability is key, but so is not driving each other mad.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, if it breaks down, the whole group suffers.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, yes, but only if the data is honest.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I agree. The administrative burden is real.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look at the fixed costs to see the baseline.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check what other households did to avoid conflict.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
