19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I will look at the hours recorded in the diary.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minako,,"Also, I will check the tax and insurance papers.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,And I will look at the spell of checking figures.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
