35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen. That is a lot to split evenly.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Other groups failed because they had to ask favours constantly.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The car was dirty and low on fuel twice this year.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,Two people bought over half the fuel. The mechanic says short runs hurt the car.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Saturdays are three times busier than Tuesdays. The heavy weeks are brutal.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, if two people drive most, an even split is unfair.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, the state of the car is a symptom of poor rules.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, yes, but I need to know it will be ready.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, I agree. We need to account for usage, not just ownership.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, the short runs are why the car is in bad shape.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,"A fixed day allocation might work, but it ignores the heavy weeks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,A booking calendar could reduce the need to ask favours.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"A primary keeper might ensure the car is ready, but who pays?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,A booking calendar with distance-based costs seems logical.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the time spent booking. Is it worth it?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minako,,Option B seems fairer if we track distance.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,Option B avoids the favour-asking trap.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"Option C might be best for reliability, but risky for the keeper.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,Option B is the most transparent.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,Option B is manageable if the system is simple.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
